  - title: "How to Write a Logistics RFP That Actually Gets You the Right Partner"
    permalink: "https://runink.org/blog/logistics-rfp-process-best-practices/"
    date: "2026-05-31T00:42:51Z"
    description: "A practical framework for logistics RFPs — an RFP is a request for proposal — covering scope, service levels, pricing models, and how to score the replies against your own numbers."
  - title: "Procurement Spend Analytics — Why You Can't Manage What You Can't See"
    permalink: "https://runink.org/blog/procurement-spend-analytics-visibility/"
    date: "2026-02-22T05:54:14Z"
    description: "Most procurement functions can see less of enterprise spend than they think, and the rest is where off-contract buying lives. How to measure your own share, and what spend analytics reads: maverick purchasing, contract leakage and price variance between business units."
